[00:04.99]1. Help in our lives, Jehovah provides,
[00:36.09]Shepherds to tend his flock.
[00:42.93]By their example they serve as guides,
[00:50.49]Showing us how to walk.
[00:57.49](Chorus)
[01:05.28]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[01:12.04]Men who are loyal and true.
[01:19.96]They show concern for his precious sheep;
[01:27.12]Love them for all that they do.
[01:49.24]2. Shepherds who love us care how we feel;
[01:56.64]Gently they guide the way.
[02:03.93]When we are hurt, they help us to heal,
[02:11.13]Kind in the words they say.
[02:14.83](Chorus)
[02:18.53]God gives us men who have earned our trust,
[02:25.93]Men who are loyal and true.
[02:33.50]They show concern for his precious sheep;
[02:40.50]Love them for all that they do.
[03:32.06]3. Godly advice and counsel they give,
[03:39.06]That we may never stray.
[03:46.06]Thus they assist us, God’s way to live,
[03:53.23]Serving him ev’ry day.
[03:56.73](Chorus)
